  "body": "[{\"title\":\"Data and Metadata Standards\",\"field_data_points\":false,\"field_data_table_format\":false,\"body\":\"\\u003Cp\\u003EThe PanKbase Consortium has defined comprehensive, rigorous standards for metadata and data processing to encourage transparency, reproducibility, and dissemination. View our standards below:\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\n\\u003Cp\\u003EMetadata Standards:\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\n\\u003Cul\\u003E\\n\\u003Cli\\u003E\\u003Ca href=\\u0022https:\\/\\/data.pankbase.org\\/standards\\/human-donor\\u0022\\u003EHuman Donors\\u003C\\/a\\u003E\\u003C\\/li\\u003E\\n\\u003Cli\\u003E\\u003Ca href=\\u0022https:\\/\\/data.pankbase.org\\/standards\\/islet-biosample\\u0022\\u003EIslet Biosamples\\u003C\\/a\\u003E\\u003C\\/li\\u003E\\n\\u003Cli\\u003E\\u003Ca href=\\u0022https:\\/\\/data.pankbase.org\\/beta-cell-line-metadata\\/\\u0022\\u003EHuman Beta Cell Lines\\u003C\\/a\\u003E\\u003C\\/li\\u003E\\n\\u003Cli\\u003E\\u003Ca href=\\u0022https:\\/\\/data.pankbase.org\\/standards\\/file-formats\\/\\u0022\\u003EFile Formats\\u003C\\/a\\u003E\\u003C\\/li\\u003E\\n\\u003Cli\\u003E\\u003Ca href=\\u0022https:\\/\\/data.pankbase.org\\/standards\\/sequence-based-assays-metadata-standards\\u0022\\u003ESequence-based Experiments\\u003C\\/a\\u003E\\u003C\\/li\\u003E\\n\\u003Cli\\u003E\\u003Ca href=\\u0022https:\\/\\/data.pankbase.org\\/standards\\/islet-function-experiment\\u0022\\u003EIslet Function Experiment\\u003C\\/a\\u003E\\u003C\\/li\\u003E\\n\\u003C\\/ul\\u003E\\n\\u003Cp\\u003EData Processing Standards:\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\n\\u003Cul\\u003E\\n\\u003Cli\\u003E\\u003Ca href=\\u0022https:\\/\\/data.pankbase.org\\/standards\\/bulk-rna-data\\/\\u0022\\u003EBulk RNA-seq\\u003C\\/a\\u003E\\u003C\\/li\\u003E\\n\\u003Cli\\u003E\\u003Ca href=\\u0022https:\\/\\/data.pankbase.org\\/pipelines\\/sn-scrnaseq-pipeline_hv\\/\\u0022\\u003ESingle Cell RNA-seq (scRNA-seq)\\u003C\\/a\\u003E\\u003C\\/li\\u003E\\n\\u003Cli\\u003E\\u003Ca href=\\u0022https:\\/\\/data.pankbase.org\\/st